## About POAP KINGS

POAP KINGS is a Clash Royale clan that celebrates effort with proof. Each season and notable milestone is commemorated by an on-chain POAP ("Proof of Attendance Protocol") badge. The clan is managed in part by Elixir, an AI chronicler that keeps the roster, awards, and promotional copy current.

